     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Sam<br><br>I was looking to a similar problem, you can see in this thread the post of <span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Richard McElreath, he attach a example code on 2 different wasy to include missing data</span></span>, personally I prefer the second approach.<br><span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/stan-users/missing$20data/stan-users/mEGf1RFBlcU/O3NLXJSsKwoJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!searchin/stan-users/missing$20data/stan-users/mEGf1RFBlcU/O3NLXJSsKwoJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466687253000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3On5qV9IfVWy2vf5PKXGgY\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/stan-users/missing$20data/stan-users/mEGf1RFBlcU/O3NLXJSsKwoJ</a><br><br>Hope this helps</span><br><br>-- Mauricio<br></span></span></div>"
    ],
