     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I would <em>love</em> to be able to follow the basic paradigm here and always, I&#39;m just not very good at it.  I&#39;ll get on our investigators about that. </div></div></div></div>"
